      "content": "thanks for the suggestions. i'm a bit worried though, i noticed a small dark bruise on my leg this morning and i've been feeling a bit lightheaded. since i'm taking the eliquis, should i be worried that the 800mg of ibuprofen might be causing some bleeding? or is that just a normal side effect of being on blood thinners and managing this level of pain?",
